flowchart LR
  subgraph Host[Trusted host application — integrator-owned]
    Receive[Bot / API / external event]
    Authority[Authenticated task context\nCurrent permissions]
    Fast[Approved deterministic code\nExisting storage and plugins]
    Bridge[Harness Bridge\nAdmission · native identity · execution\nBounded cleanup · result gate]
    Deliver[Current audience / accounting checks\nPersistence and delivery]
    Receive --> Authority
    Authority --> Fast
    Authority --> Bridge
    Fast --> Deliver
    Bridge --> Deliver
  end
  subgraph Native[Reused OpenShell — Docker binding]
    Control[Native CLI / trusted control plane\nLifecycle · policy · provider configuration]
    subgraph Workload[Fresh untrusted task workload]
      DSH[Existing DSH headless Harness\nOrdinary Skill + tools + workspace]
    end
    Control --> DSH
    DSH --> Control
  end
  Bridge -->|Existing native CLI| Control
  Control -->|Output + session evidence| Bridge
  Control -->|Policy-approved egress only| External[Existing model provider / scoped APIs\nBusiness API owns data authorization]
